?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tUWP8B4VG9sQ7kNvwGmKp2r&_nc_oc=Adpm7bgUeurX0daLIMCgZ_8SZxv1JnQD6dqvvInSTd9cMOR7azlRxcO6xWiNhyTAArE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7v4fGIfdFuluVlWT822dLgByAW1zwxfqjFT0jKcQwv3Q&oe=69FB2BCD"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2025-06-26-14h57m40s619.png", "id": "1362965244997410", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828836_1362965248330743_8857805389436387068_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-KD5f8fcoJ8Q7kNvwGYWYwG&_nc_oc=AdqinDMk8iaikiEK65p9eLzT8fEqGhzl-fRPWnSHqLAn0WWPCXH-xUNYB4sTxqSk0-k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7gk68x07TkIyJeguK5l1UWDiVzpkAJZBZ_iexfTclm_Q&oe=69FB5263"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2025-06-26-15h36m21s860.png", "id": "709012702102710", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618284_709012708769376_3470925897511064858_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hptHbQzI944Q7kNvwFe7lUx&_nc_oc=Adps2D3ZO1jPgmmjQeySa7TSdZLGaRb2djxYJKoKF3K4cvMf-PwTLjkQH8kjGzL8kIw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7WM9fdVIdtT26xZmmnL4lWvCJnhVLsVdVhvEzQZm7J1Q&oe=69FB5E13"}, {"file_name": "ssMenu.png", "id": "1055955313347234", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618297_1055955316680567_1044107595197462832_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Yz2NTpjVgZAQ7kNvwG8aODW&_nc_oc=Adq8N2fgPgk-vYYA7N_HNhG6NQyR2QG77vPbLJl3wgefdICF5fMJUduUdadFg4UIpo0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af69FeXbn2nYti8rMFUpGEkw0ZreX0jpcEb0Qv7Fnvekwg&oe=69FB40FE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover1.png", "id": "1177756150686533", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827626_1177756154019866_4024787996372402027_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=olmSopYamjsQ7kNvwEuFeKo&_nc_oc=AdpgsdYun83HZw81ltCnXNCgeCZaZs7xwOTxoHw5Dz7T-t5Zd5NsV7yzZvD6J-STQMI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af65XYYbYRsv26qNvWds9BTngnL6npejZa07L1Kaa-AUkQ&oe=69FB4D44"}, "display_name": "I am Mouse : Adventure Simulator", "keywords": ["iam", "mouse", "simulator", "adventure"], "long_description": "Shrink down and step into the whiskers of a curious little mouse in I Am Mouse: Adventure Simulator, a charming and immersive VR journey packed with exploration, problem-solving, and a bit of cheesy mischief!\n\nTravel through three creative environments built for VR fun:\n\ud83c\udfe0 House \u2013 Navigate through a cozy home, solve small-scale puzzles, and collect hidden cheese in each of the five levels.\n\ud83d\udcbc Office \u2013 Explore a busy workspace from a mouse\u2019s perspective, complete playful tasks, and discover secret nooks and crannies.\n\ud83e\ude90 Space Station \u2013 Float through a low-gravity environment, interact with futuristic tools, and enjoy light, sci-fi-themed adventures.\n\nEach map is filled with interactive elements, environmental challenges, and delightful surprises. Designed for comfort and creativity, I Am Mouse offers intuitive controls, engaging visuals, and a unique perspective on everyday spaces.\n\nWhether you're a fan of light-hearted exploration or just want to experience life from a new point of view, I Am Mouse: Adventure Simulator is a family-friendly VR escape into tiny paws and big imagination.\n\nSqueak, scurry, and explore\u2014your mouse-sized adventure begins now!", "short_description": "Experience life as a tiny explorer in I Am Mouse: Adventure Simulator, a fun and family-friendly VR adventure! Scurry through a house, office, and space station as a curious mouse. Collect cheese, solve small tasks, and discover the world from a whole new perspective. Three interactive maps, tons of surprises, and all the charm of a whiskered hero\u2014your squeaky VR journey starts now!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tretastudios.com/vrprivacypolicy.php"